d\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">★ 4.6 · 1,840 reviews</div>\n      <div class=\"small\"><b>Best for:</b> Travel and everyday work</div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"small up\">+ Gorgeous OLED panel<br>+ Great battery<br>+ Quiet under load</div>\n      <div class=\"small down\">− Soldered RAM<br>− Glossy screen</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Choose Aero 14</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack\" id=\"c-Forge 16\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h3>Forge 16</h3><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Most powerful</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">★ 4.4 · 960 reviews</div>\n      <div class=\"small\"><b>Best for:</b> Video editing, 3D and gaming</div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"small up\">+ Fastest of the three<br>+ Upgradeable RAM and SSD<br>+ Full port selection</div>\n      <div class=\"small down\">− Heavy<br>− Fans are audible</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Choose Forge 16</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack\" id=\"c-Nimbus 13\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h3>Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best value</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">★ 4.2 · 2,310 reviews</div>\n      <div class=\"small\"><b>Best for:</b> Students and light office work</div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"small up\">+ Lightest<br>+ Best battery life<br>+ Lowest price</div>\n      <div class=\"small down\">− Dimmer screen<br>− Small SSD</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Choose Nimbus 13</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Specifications</div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Best value in each row is marked ✓.</p>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Spec</th><th>Aero 14</th><th>Forge 16</th><th>Nimbus 13</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Price</td><td class=\"num\">$1,299</td><td class=\"num\">$1,899</td><td class=\"num\">$999 ✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED ✓</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W ✓</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>RAM</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td><td class=\"num\">32 GB ✓</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">512 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1,024 GB ✓</td><td class=\"num\">256 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weight</td><td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td><td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td><td class=\"num\">1.0 kg ✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Battery</td><td class=\"num\">18 h</td><td class=\"num\">9 h</td><td class=\"num\">22 h ✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card ✓</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Rating</td><td class=\"num\">4.6 ✓</td><td class=\"num\">4.4</td><td class=\"num\">4.2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Reviews</td><td class=\"num\">1,840</td><td class=\"num\">960</td><td class=\"num\">2,310 ✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Price per GB storage</td><td class=\"num\">$2.54</td><td class=\"num\">$1.85 ✓</td><td class=\"num\">$3.90</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Battery hours per $1,000</td><td class=\"num\">13.9</td><td class=\"num\">4.7</td><td class=\"num\">22.0 ✓</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1}]}'></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Verdict</div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div><b>Aero 14</b><p class=\"small muted\">The balanced pick: premium OLED, 18 h battery and the top rating at a mid price. Note RAM is soldered, so choose carefully.</p></div>\n      <div><b>Forge 16</b><p class=\"small muted\">For heavy creative or gaming work. $600 more than Nimbus, but double the RAM, quadruple the storage, and upgradeable. Expect weight and fan noise.</p></div>\n      <div><b>Nimbus 13</b><p class=\"small muted\">The budget, ultraportable choice with the longest battery. Limited ports, a dimmer screen and 256 GB storage are the trade-offs.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst picks={\n  value:[\"Nimbus 13\",\"Lowest price at $999, and the best battery hours per dollar.\"],\n  battery:[\"Nimbus 13\",\"22 hours of battery and the lightest build at 1.0 kg.\"],\n  power:[\"Forge 16\",\"16-core 55 W CPU, 32 GB RAM, 1 TB storage and upgradeable parts.\"],\n  screen:[\"Aero 14\",\"The 14\\\" OLED is the standout panel; Nimbus is dimmer.\"],\n  rating:[\"Aero 14\",\"Highest rating at 4.6 from 1,840 reviews.\"]\n};\nfunction setPick(k){\n  document.querySelectorAll('#prio button').forEach(b=>b.className='btn btn-sm'+(b.dataset.p===k?'':' btn-outline'));\n  const [n,t]=picks[k];\n  document.getElementById('pick').innerHTML='<b>Recommended: '+n+'.</b> '+t;\n  ['Aero 14','Forge 16','Nimbus 13'].forEach(x=>{\n    document.getElementById('c-'+x).style.outline=x===n?'2px solid currentColor':'none';\n  });\n}\ndocument.query